4. Included an ErrorBoundary component to catch and handle any rendering errors
5. Expanded the mock props to include more potentially required properties
6. Disabled SSR for the imported component since we're in a preview environment
7. Added proper loading states and error fallbacks

The changes should help resolve the module fetching error by:
- Handling the dynamic import more gracefully
- Providing fallback content if the import fails
